    "description": "Are you a skilled Radiologist looking for your next big career move? 3M India Healthcare Digital Technologies in Vijayawada offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout 3M India Healthcare Digital Technologies:\n3M India Healthcare Digital Technologies is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct routine health assessments and screenings\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Maintain accurate clinical documentation in electronic health records\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Attend continuing medical education programs and training\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Bachelor's degree in a relevant field\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in Health Informatics\n• Proficiency in CPT Codes\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Pharmacovigilance\n• Proficiency in Clinical Documentation\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Referral bonus program\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with 3M India Healthcare Digital Technologies!",
